{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973000/extras/b042632dfd468e47e0174874cb6d900e.avif?t=1758701079\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Infected Love: The Fatal Experiment [Confession on Infection Day]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Truth Hidden in the School (Demo)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Your heart will race\u2026 not knowing if it\u2019s because of love, or the sound of zombies behind the door.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What should have been the start of an ordinary school life turns into an unimaginable nightmare. You will take on the role of Haru Misaki (or a name of your choice) and begin your survival alongside three companions Luna, Miya, and Scarlett in a high school cut off from the outside world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Here\u2019s what you\u2019ll get in the demo version:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Playtime \u2013 Approximately 40\u201360 minutes (depending on your play style).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Interact with all three main characters, featuring dialogue exclusive to the demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Test the relationship and decision-making system \u2014 your choices will affect conversations and events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore initial survival areas within the school, such as the infirmary, cafeteria, and staff room, to find food, medicine, and communication devices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Discover partial clues hinting at the cause of why the school became what it is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Risky branching paths  Wrong decisions may lead to Game Over</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3973000?t=1758701079","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_